/TMAS - TRANSFER CONTENTS OF PROCESSOR
/AC TO TMA SETUP REGISTER (TMAS)
/READ IT BACK AND TEST FOR DISCREPANCY
/THE BIT PATTERN IS DETERMINED BY THE
/LEFT SWITCHES
/PROCEED TO NEXT TEST IF NO ERRORS
	 
